*.duplicate_patch_idx_bak
# Heavy regeneratable artifacts — kept on disk for downstream analysis,
# excluded from git. Regenerate from best.pt + patches if needed.
**/patches.npz
models/contour_vae_*/best.pt
models/contour_vae_*/last.pt
results/contour_vae_*/latents.parquet
# Phase 5 cross-cohort diagnostic figures — small and analytically valuable.
!results/phase5_cross_cohort/*.png

# Shape-representation v2 artifacts (2026-05-25 post-merge reconciliation, R-C).
# Rig-local + regeneratable; canonical paths in docs/DATA_LOCATIONS.md.
# Intentionally PATH-SPECIFIC, not blanket *.npz/*.parquet/*.joblib — the repo
# tracks production .pt CNN models and results/batch_*/summary.parquet (keepers).
models/shape_kmeans/
models/latent_kmeans/
**/true_registered_ridges*.npz
results/latent_dispersion/
results/latent_repertoire/
results/latent_transitions/
results/compare_3452_9252/
results/contour_vae_combined/reconstructions/

# Security — rig SSH-coordinate leakage protection (added 2026-05-20 after audit).
# These paths contain plaintext Tailscale IP / SSH-user / hostname for the rig.
# To version-control any of them: sanitize first (replace literals with <RIG_*>
# placeholders), then `git add` by exact path.
/handoff_to_rig/
/docs/handoffs/*rig*.md
/docs/handoffs/2026-05-10_lab-finetune-experiment-matrix*.md
